    EditorialLessonRecord("Class 11–12|Atomic Structure: Senior Secondary|Isotopes and ions",
        "explicit topic alias",
        "Isotopes are atoms of the same element with the same proton number but different neutron numbers.\n\nIsoelectronic species have the same total number of electrons.",
